.TH HAMSTIK 1 "HAMSTIK WORK COMMENT LIST"
.SH NAME
hamstik work comment list \- List comments on a work item
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B hamstik work comment list [OPTIONS]
.SH DESCRIPTION
List comments on a work item
.SH ARGUMENTS
.TP
.I KEY
Work item key
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B --exclude-deleted
Hide soft-deleted comments instead of rendering `(deleted)` placeholders
Choices: true, false
.TP
.B --limit
Maximum items per page (endpoint maximum is 100 or 200)
.TP
.B --cursor
Opaque continuation cursor
.TP
.B --all
Follow all pages
Choices: true, false
